        "fields": {
          "notes": "One work identity connects separately identified German publication and manuscript routes and translation expressions. The authorial-witness route preserves region-level notebook attribution, D 17 for part IV, the corrected GSA 71/25a private-print ensemble, and eKGWB critical addresses. The provisional uncredited Russian Reader Expression and the Nani nine-fragment Expression provide two distinct 1899 translation routes, with textual relationships awaiting assessment."
